<p id="p1" class="Note"><span style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Note</b></span>: It is not recommended to use this function on meshes, that contain smooth or round details – it will additionally sharpen them, which may not be desirable. If you apply sharpening on part of an object, make the selection close to the edges.</p>
<p class="Use"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span> <span class="Command">Enhance Features</span> <span lang="EN-GB">to sharpen only the feature lines of a mesh.</span></p>
